WEBVTT

00:02:28.200 --> 00:02:31.296
letters with anthrax,
airplanes as weapons,

00:02:31.320 --> 00:02:33.176
mass rape as a military strategy.

00:02:33.200 --> 00:02:35.480
We're a miserably violent species.

00:02:35.920 --> 00:02:37.416
But there's a complication,

00:02:37.440 --> 00:02:39.816
which is we don't hate violence,

00:02:39.840 --> 00:02:41.696
we hate the wrong kind.

00:02:41.720 --> 00:02:43.176
And when it's the right kind,

00:02:43.200 --> 00:02:45.696
we cheer it on, we hand out medals,

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:48.856
we vote for, we mate with
our champions of it.

00:02:48.880 --> 00:02:50.696
When it's the right kind of violence,

00:02:50.720 --> 00:02:51.920
we love it.

00:02:52.520 --> 00:02:54.176
And there's another complication,

00:02:54.200 --> 00:02:58.256
which is, in addition to us
being this miserably violent species,

00:02:58.280 --> 00:03:02.080
we're also this extraordinarily
altruistic, compassionate one.